## To get AI help inside VS Code

- **Claude Code** - open the Claude panel, ask "help me merge".
  The extension auto-reads `CLAUDE.md`.
- **Codex** - open the Codex panel; reads `AGENTS.md`.
- **GitHub Copilot Chat** - `/explain` or `/fix`; reads
  `.github/copilot-instructions.md`.

All three see the same context: the mods involved, the syntax,
and the constraints.
